Why This Is Asked
Tests cross-region DR, data residency, and immutable auditing in a realistic fintech context where latency targets are strict and analytics must co-exist with OLTP.

Key Concepts
- Aurora Global Database topology and cross-region replication
- Immutable audit logging with S3 Object Lock and KMS
- Data residency controls and per-tenant access (RLS)

